**African Drumming Workshop**

## **Bassidi Kone's 'RHYTHMS OF MALI'** 

African Drumming Workshops return to the Sunshine Coast with Bassidi Kone from Mali. [![African Drumming Workshops](/media/2013/06/Bassidi-Kone-flyer.jpg)](/drumming-workshops/bassidi-kone-flyer/) World class master drummer, Bassidi Kone is a supportive, warm and patient teacher with positive energy and an infectious smile He has exceptional knowledge of Mali's cultural music and heritage. Learn traditional djembe and dundun parts for rhythms of MALI. Be sure not to miss this event and keep posted for more information. Book Now!

## African Drumming Workshops @ Palmwoods Memorial Hall

Saturday July 13th 10-11.30am Bookings Essential email: info@rhythmculture.com.au ph:0434585992
